      <Desc>The 20th San Diego SABPA BioPharma Conference (October 5, 2024)Address: Hilton San Diego/Del Mar, 15575 Jimmy Durante Blvd, Del Mar, CAFor the past 20 years, San Diego BioPharma Conference, the flagship event of SABPA, has witnessed the boom of the pharmaceuticals and biotechnology industry in one of the nation's premier innovation centers. From potential Nobel laureates and technologically disruptive inventors to entrepreneurs and multi-billion-dollar dealmakers, this annual conference has been featuring some of the most respectful figures in the fields. This year, the long-awaited in-person conference is back.Program highlights are as follows:1. Fireside Chats on Taking a Research Organization towards Commercialization2. Breakthrough Prize Winner achievements in Serial Innovation in Drug Development3. The journey From Academia to Industry in Neuroscience IPOs4. Discovering the transformative impact of Moores Cancer Center's New Director, a world-renowned Pancreatic SurgeonDelving into cutting-edge innovations like Next-Gen Chemo proteomics Platforms</Desc>
      <ProgSrvcAccomActy2Grp>
        <ExpenseAmt>72008</ExpenseAmt>
        <RevenueAmt>66077</RevenueAmt>
        <Desc>The 8th Annual Frontiers in Therapeutics and Diagnostics (FTD) Forum (March 23, 2024)Address: Hilton San Diego/Del Mar, 15575 Jimmy Durante Blvd, Del Mar, CASABPA FTD annually brings together the latest in groundbreaking research, cutting-edge drugs, and industry trends within the biopharma sector. The event's broad spectrum of topics provides a platform for local biotech companies to engage in vibrant discussions and valuable networking opportunities. The forthcoming 8th FTD Conference was set to shine a spotlight on three revolutionary domains in the field of metabolism disease and oncology: Glucagon-like peptide-1 (GLP-1), Antibody-Drug Conjugates (ADC), and Minimal Residual Disease (MRD), each representing the forefront of innovations in therapeutics and diagnostics. Program highlights are as follows:1. GLP-1 receptor agonists, from diabetes to obesity and beyond2. The rise of ADC - a biological missile, for targeted cancer therapy3. Reinventing drug discovery with AI-powered automation4. Frontiers in MRD detection to increase chance of cancer cure</Desc>
      </ProgSrvcAccomActy2Grp>
      <ProgSrvcAccomActy3Grp>
