        <RevenueAmt>19406</RevenueAmt>
        <Desc>SABPA OC/LA 16th Annual Biomedical Forum (April 20, 2024)Address: The Beckman Center, 100 Academy, Irvine, CA, 92617SABPA OC/LA annually brings together the latest innovations in biomedical industries, cutting-edge developments of pharmaceuticals and medical devices, entrepreneurship, and career development. The event's broad spectrum of topics provides a platform for local biotech and medical device companies to engage in vibrant discussions and valuable networking opportunities.</Desc>
